sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements GattClient]

    Note over Product, CN: Operations are sequential: wait for OperationComplete

    Product->>CN: GattClient.ReadCharacteristic(0x0025)
    CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.ReadCharacteristicResponse(<br>data={handle=0x0025, data=0x64})
    CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)

    Product->>CN: GattClient.WriteCharacteristic(handle=0x0025, data=0x01)
    CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)

    Product->>CN: GattClient.WriteCharacteristicWithoutResponse(<br>handle=0x0027, data=0x11 0x22 0x33)
    Note right of CN: Fire-and-forget, no OperationComplete

    Product->>CN: GattClient.ReadDescriptor(0x0026)
    CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.ReadDescriptorResponse(<br>data={handle=0x0026, data=0x0000})
    CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)

    Product->>CN: GattClient.WriteDescriptor(<br>handle=0x0026, data=0x0100)
    Note right of Product: 0x0100 = notifications enabled (CCCD)
    CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)
